  "overview": "The Ultimate Puzzle Game in a Wacky World of Animals!\n\nYou're the zookeeper in a crazy kingdom. But you'd better watch out - once you dive into the Baku Baku den, there's no turning back...\n\n- To win, match each animal with its favorite food.\n- Challenge computer characters or go head-to-head in 2-player mode.\n- Beautiful 3-D graphics and stunning colors bring puzzling to the next level.\n- Variable game speed lets you go slow-mo or full throttle.\n- Better be clever: surprises await true Baku masters..."
